commit 9b08c8613fae316d8d4667ea2c890aec784f2b21
Author: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date:   Fri Aug 7 18:09:27 2026 +0000

    Fix Meghadut spelling, restyle CTA to Experience, revert wordmark to Space Grotesk
    
    - Corrected "MeghDut" to "Meghadut" everywhere it's displayed (card
      title, modal title, body copy, image alt text) — image filename
      left as-is since renaming assets isn't needed.
    - Renamed the "Visit Website" button to "Experience" and switched it
      from the glass/outline button style to the solid accent-fill style
      (already used elsewhere for primary CTAs) across all three products
      that have it: Meghadut, Mahik-Fitness, Samik.
    - Nav wordmark now uses Space Grotesk (the site's existing heading
      font) instead of Playfair Display, with a bold/muted weight split
      (700 for "Trigun", 500 for "Robotic Systems") and tighter
      letter-spacing. Re-verified no overlap with the nav links/toggle
      button across 27 widths from 320px to 1440px.

